<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dim">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Climate Solutions</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">

        <div class="hero bg-base-200 rounded-lg my-6">
            <div class="hero-content text-center">
                <div>
                    <h1>Climate Solutions</h1>
                    <p class="my-4">Explore different climate solutions that can help protect the environment.</p>
                    <a href="/explorer/solutions" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Solutions</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
                <figure>
                    <img src="https://drawdown.org/sites/default/files/styles/crop_to_square_1080/public/media/FY25_Solutions_Restore%20Forests%20Boreal_2400x2400_0.jpg?itok=isLIdV73" alt="Restore Forests">
                </figure>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Restore Forests</h2>
                    <p>Forest restoration could sequester up to 1.437 Gt CO₂-eq per year, with most climate benefits occurring in tropical regions.</p>
                    <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                        <a href="/explorer/solutions/1" class="btn btn-primary">Learn more</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
                <figure>
                    <img src="https://drawdown.org/sites/default/files/styles/crop_to_square_1080/public/media/FY25_Solutions_CementProduction_2400x2400.jpg?itok=iHk3DawS" alt="Improve Cement Production">
                </figure>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Improve Cement Production</h2>
                    <p>Improving cement production can reduce GHG emissions by using alternative materials, cleaner fuels, and more efficient processes.</p>
                    <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                        <a href="/explorer/solutions/2" class="btn btn-primary">Learn more</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
                <figure>
                    <img src="https://drawdown.org/sites/default/files/styles/crop_to_square_1080/public/media/FY25_Solutions_Carpooling_2400x2400.jpeg?itok=M9LFO1-z" alt="Increase Carpooling">
                </figure>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="card-title">Increase Carpooling</h2>
                    <p>Increasing carpooling reduces transportation emissions by putting fewer vehicles on the road and improving fuel efficiency.</p>
                    <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                        <a href="/explorer/solutions/3" class="btn btn-primary">Learn more</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>